# EOS-backed internals. The editor ignores this folder so the base opens clean
# WITHOUT GD-EOS installed (its classes would otherwise be "not declared"). The
# code is loaded lazily at runtime only when GD-EOS is present, so ignoring it
# here changes nothing at runtime. scripts/fetch-eos.sh deletes these markers
# when you install GD-EOS, so the code parses and exports normally with online on.
